{"sentence_id": "hb-c08-u0070-s003", "text": "Syftet med elevhandledningen är dessutom att vägleda eleverna i valet av fortsatta studier.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c08-stod/narration/resume-20261103T022335040949+0000-3/hb-c08-u0070-s003.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 8.428843537414966, "peak": 0.275146484375, "generation_seconds": 18.50341639481485, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c08-u0070-s004", "text": "Handledning i studiefärdigheter och valet av fortsatta studier ges i olika skeden av den grundläggande utbildningen för hela klasser eller en enskild elev i taget.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c08-stod/narration/resume-20261103T022335040949+0000-3/hb-c08-u0070-s004.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 13.862312925170068, "peak": 0.418609619140625, "generation_seconds": 28.9405572488904, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c08-u0070-s005", "text": "Elevhandledaren, som är en lärare specialiserad på handledningsarbete, håller lektioner i elevhandledning.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c08-stod/narration/resume-20261103T022335040949+0000-3/hb-c08-u0070-s005.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 9.125442176870749, "peak": 0.243255615234375, "generation_seconds": 20.90837978385389, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c08-u0071-s001", "text": "Enligt lagen ska eleverna få tillräckligt stöd för lärandet och skolgången under hela grundskolan.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c08-stod/narration/resume-20261103T022335040949+0000-3/hb-c08-u0071-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 8.219863945578231, "peak": 0.31646728515625, "generation_seconds": 21.22296504303813, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c08-u0071-s002", "text": "Eleven kan behöva stöd till exempel för att hen har en sjukdom, funktionsnedsättning eller inlärningssvårighet.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c08-stod/narration/resume-20261103T022335040949+0000-3/hb-c08-u0071-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 9.543401360544218, "peak": 0.2928466796875, "generation_seconds": 34.905231242999434, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c08-u0071-s003", "text": "Om en elev behöver stöd, utreds hens situation tillsammans med eleven, vårdnadshavarna, skolan och sakkunniga.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c08-stod/narration/resume-20261103T022335040949+0000-3/hb-c08-u0071-s003.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 9.822040816326531, "peak": 0.314300537109375, "generation_seconds": 32.29794668406248, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c08-u0071-s004", "text": "Vårdnadshavarnas samarbete med läraren är viktigt för att stödet ska kunna säkerställas.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c08-stod/narration/resume-20261103T022335040949+0000-3/hb-c08-u0071-s004.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 7.87156462585034, "peak": 0.3768310546875, "generation_seconds": 26.816299363970757, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c08-u0072-s001", "text": "Eleverna kan få stöd för skolgången på olika sätt.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c08-stod/narration/resume-20261103T022335040949+0000-3/hb-c08-u0072-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 4.667210884353741, "peak": 0.262725830078125, "generation_seconds": 17.184134391136467, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
